SUMMARY:Litter Cleanup (Monroe)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF Union County Wildlife Chapter as we partner with the Monroe Stormwater to clean up streams in Monroe\, NC. Volunteers will help clean up trash in and along the Bearskin Creek. We hope you will be part of this fun\, educational\, and important workday for protecting our aquatic communities! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/litter-sweep-monroe/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/1787168265426.jpg
END:VEVENT
