SUMMARY:From Fields to Forests: Managing for Pollinators
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF conservationist John Isenhour and NCWRC biologist Gabriela Garrison for a 0.8-mile hike through meadows and woods to learn how prescribed fire\, mechanical clearing\, and herbicide treatments build native plant diversity. Through hands-on insect identification\, you’ll see how a rich herbaceous layer sustains native pollinators and supports your wildlife goals year-round. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/from-fields-to-forests-managing-for-pollinators/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
